[10:10p.m] #ThirdMainlandBridge #3MB #TrafficUpdate 

Traffic is very good in and out of the Third Mainland Bridge.

Driving from Ilubirin to Adeniji, Adekunle, Unilag Water-front to Ilaje and the exit lay-by is all good.

Remember to drive safe and keep it within regulated speed limits.

